          "caption": "The train made a five minute stop at Kjosfoss waterfall. The station is located between two tunnels, and there is no exit from the platform - the whole station is built just to enjoy the view of the waterfall.\nAn ethereal music was playing over the sounds of the waterfall, and soon a couple of elves appeared dancing on the rocks.\n\nThe show lasted a couple of minutes. When the music stopped, everyone returned to the train and we continued our journey to Myrdal.",
